---
import PageLayout from '../layouts/PageLayout.astro';
---

<PageLayout
  title="About MobileFlow"
  description="MobileFlow is built by HexaOne Labs to remove the Mac, Xcode, and certificate hassle from shipping Capacitor apps."
  eyebrow="About us"
>
  <p>
    Publishing a mobile app shouldn't require a Mac, Xcode, Android Studio, and a personal
    relationship with your certificate manager. That barrier is disproportionate to the actual
    difficulty of building the app itself — and it's the problem MobileFlow exists to remove.
  </p>
  <p>
    MobileFlow connects to your GitHub repository, compiles your Capacitor app for Android and iOS
    using GitHub Actions, signs the binaries with the certificates you upload once to the Secret
    Vault, and hands you back the artifact. No local install, no manual certificate juggling on
    every release.
  </p>
  <h2>Who it's for</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>Freelancers shipping client apps who don't want to maintain a Mac.</li>
    <li>Small agencies automating builds across several apps at once.</li>
    <li>Web developers — Angular, React, Ionic — without native mobile tooling on hand.</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>Built by HexaOne Labs</h2>
  <p>
    MobileFlow is designed and built by <a
      href="https://hexaonelabs.com/"
      target="_blank"
      rel="noopener noreferrer">HexaOne Labs</a
    >. Have a question about the product or the team? <a href="/contact">Get in touch</a>.
  </p>
</PageLayout>
